# SCENE · buy one fish and name it on the spot: $1 is the species row, $2 the name.
# A botfish is bought, never caught (§19), so every circuit starts here.

run /shop
key enter
select Fishes
key enter
expect Price/unit
select $1
snap the fish catalogue with $1 marked
key enter
expect Name it
type $2
snap $1 is named on the spot
key enter
absent Name it
key esc
key esc
key esc
absent Price/unit
